{"title":"Snakeskins for the Tailor","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Wanted: eight snakeskin knicks for snakeskin work. The coral snakes in the valley southeast of Underleaf carry them. Bring them to my burrow near this board. (The Underleaf Tailor)</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/tailor\">Tailor</a></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>12</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/snakeskin-knick\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/9728c594370aae49ebbb.svg\" alt=\"\">Snakeskin Knick</a> <b>×8</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/tailor\">Tailor</a> <span class=\"muted\">(inside Binxonia - Tailor (near Binxonia))</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"tailor\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Bring 8 snakeskin knicks to the Tailor in Underleaf <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/snakeskin-knick\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/9728c594370aae49ebbb.svg\" alt=\"\">Snakeskin Knick</a> <span class=\"muted\">inside <a href=\"#\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"place\" data-map-id=\"Underleaf\">Underleaf</a></span></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>160</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>6,000</td></tr><tr><td>Tailoring XP</td><td>250</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Tailor says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Tailor:</b> Eight knicks, and hardly a nick in them. I can make something of these.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Tailor:</b> Your pay, and a little of what I know about working a skin.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"Good skins. Watch the board for my next order.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Snakeskins for the Tailor</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-snakeskins-for-the-tailor\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-snakeskins-for-the-tailor\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-snakeskins-for-the-tailor\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-snakeskins-for-the-tailor\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-snakeskins-for-the-tailor\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Tailor says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-snakeskins-for-the-tailor\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}